&HEAD CHID='rt_blob3d_32', TITLE='Role 3 e2e: 32x32x32 mesh, triply periodic' /
This is a driver test input of the Role 3 end-to-end tests (tests/run_e2e_driver.sh): triply periodic unit cube, two species of equal molecular weight (the second one is a passive
tracer; the tracer blobs and the constant velocity are set by the test mode, not by this input), uniform temperature.

&MESH IJK=32,32,32, XB=0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0 /

&TIME T_END=1.0 /

&MISC SIMULATION_MODE='DNS', STRATIFICATION=.FALSE., NOISE=.FALSE., CFL_MAX=0.25 /

&RADI RADIATION=.FALSE./

&SPEC ID='BACKGROUND',BACKGROUND=.TRUE.,MW=28.0,VISCOSITY=0.002,SPECIFIC_HEAT=1.0 /
&SPEC ID='TRACER',MW=28.0,VISCOSITY=0.002,SPECIFIC_HEAT=1.0 /

&VENT PBX=0, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT PBX=1, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT PBY=0, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT PBY=1, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT PBZ=0, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT PBZ=1, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /

&TAIL /
